<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">Tita</book>
  <para style="h">Tita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tita</para>
  <para style="mt">Tita</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei Paula hi, Pathian chhiahhlawh leh Isua Krista tirhkoh, Pathian mi thlante rinnaa kaihruai tûr leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />sakhaw lam thu dik, chatuan nun beiseina chu hriattîr tûra ruat ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Daw ngai lo Pathian chuan chu chu leilung pian hmain a lo tiam tawh a, ama thu ang ngeiin ṭha a tih hun takah a rawn tilang ta a, min Chhandamtu Pathian thupêk anga chu Chanchin Ṭha puan hna chu kawltîr ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan pawm tlân rinna avânga ka fa tak tak Tita, chibai ka bûk a che. Pa Pathian leh min chhandamtu Krista Isua hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna i hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thil tihfel bâk tifel tûrin Kret thliarkârah ka hnutchhiah che a, thu ka pêk che ang khân khaw tinah upate ruatsak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Upate chu sawisêl kai lo, nupui pakhat nei an ni tûr a ni; an fate pawh ringtu, nawmsakbâwl lama sawisêl kai lo leh luhlul lo ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kohhran hotu chu Pathian chhûngkaw enkawltu a ni a, sawisêl kai lo mi ni rawh se; mahni thu duh, thinram, zu rui mi, kut thlâk hmang, bawlhhlawh taka hlêp duh mi ni suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi inphal, thil ṭha duh, insûm thei, mi ngîl, mi thianghlim, mahni inthunun thei ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan inzirtîrna thu rinawm tak hi man fuhtu a ni bawk tûr a ni; tichuan, zirtîrna dik a zirtîr thei ang a, hnialtute a timualpho thei bawk dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tam tak thunun ngai, pâwt mai mai, mi bum chîng an awm ṭeuh kha, chûngte chu serh tanho zînga mi an ni deuh ber;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />an kâ huhsak tûr a ni; a chhûng chhûngin mite an chawk buai a, sum hmuh beiseiin zirtîr loh tûr tûr an zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kret mi, anmahni zâwlnei pakhat ngei pawhin, “Kret thliarkâr mite hi mi dawthei, ram sakawlh ang, thatchhe si, vir tak si an ni,” a tih hi thu dik tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, rinna dik an neih theih nân na takin zilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Juda-te thawnthu mai mai leh thutak hawisan tawhte thu zâwm tawh suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi thianghlimte tân zawng engkim hi a thianghlim a, mi bawlhhlawhte leh rinna nei lote tân erawh chuan eng mah hi thianghlim aram a awm lo; an thinlung leh an chhia leh ṭha hriatna chenin a bawlhhlawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian hriaah an inngai a; mahse, an thiltihin a zir si lo; mi luhlul leh ngeiawm tak an ni a, thil ṭha eng atân mah an tlâktlai tawh lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan zirtîrna dik i zirtîr zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Putarte chu insûm thei, zahawm, inthunun thei, rin dân dik, hmangaihna nei mi leh mi dawhthei ni tûrin fuih rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin pitarte pawh an chêt dâna Pathian ṭih mi ni tûrin fuih la, mi rêl hmang, uain heh mi ni suh se; thil ṭha zirtîr chîng sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />la nula deuhte chu an pasalte leh an fate hmangaih te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />insûm theih te, thianghlim te, in chhûnga khawsak ṭhat te, ngilneih te leh pasal thu awih te zirtîr rawh; tichuan, Pathian thu hi sawichhiat a ni dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin tlangvâlte pawh mahni inthunun tûrin fuih rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang phei chu thil ṭha tinrêng tih kawngah entawn tlâk takin awm la, zahawm tak leh tihtakzetin mite zirtîr ṭhîn la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ṭawngkam mawi, sawisêl tûr awm lo chu hmang ṭhîn ang che; tichuan, hnialtuten min sawichhiatna tûr rêng rêng an nei lo vang a, an zak zâwk dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawihte chu kawng engkimah an pute hnênah intulût rawh se; an lâwm zâwngin awm sela, an chhâng lêt ve tûr a ni lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />an ei rûksak tûr a ni bawk lo; kawng engkimah rin tlâk takin an awm zâwk tûr a ni; tichuan, kan Pathian min chhandamtu zirtîrna thu hi engkimah a hlutzia an tilang dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng chhandam an nih theih nân Pathian khawngaihna chu tihlan a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tûnlai hunah hian Pathian ngaihsak lohna leh khawvêl lam thil bânsan te, mahni invawng fela, dik taka awma sakhaw ngaihsak nun te min zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan Pathian ropui leh min chhandamtu Isua Krista ropui taka a lo lanna ni lâwmawm kan beisei hi tihhlawhtlin a nih hun kan nghâk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah ngei chu kan tân a inpe a, bawhchhiatna tinrêng lak ata min tlan chhuak a, ama mi atân min tithianghlim a, thil ṭha tih châkna min pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hêng thu hi i hrilh tûr a ni; fuih la, thunei takin zilh rawh. Tu man ngainêp che suh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I mite chu rorêltute leh thuneitute thu awih tûr leh, thil ṭha tinrêng tih inpeih reng tûrin hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu pawi mah sawi suh se; zâwldawhin mi zawng zawng lakah nunnêm tak leh hawihhâwm takin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmânah chuan keini pawh mâwl tak, luhlul tak, hruai bova awm, châkna leh nawmsakna chi tinrêng bawiha awm kan ni a, mi îtsîka elrelin kan khawsa a; huatthlala tak, inhuat tawn chîng mi kan ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, min chhandamtu Pathian ngilneihzia leh mi a hmangaihzia a lo lan khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />keinin thil kan tih ṭhat vâng ni lovin, a khawngaihna avângin min chhandam ta a, siamtharnaa sil fai leh Thlarau Thianghlima siam thar kan ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Min chhandamtu Isua Krista zârah kan chungah hian a thlarau chu a rawn leih ta chiam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tichuan, khawngaihna avânga thiam min chantîrin, chatuan nun beiseina roluahtute kan ni thei ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />He thu hi a dik a ni. Pathian ringtute chuan thil ṭha tih duhna rilru an put zêl theih nân hêng thu hi uar tûrin ka duh che a ni; chu chu a ṭha a, tu tân pawh a ṭangkai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Inhnialna âtthlâk te, thlahtu chhui vak vak te, Dân thu-a inhnial luai luai te kalsan rawh; ṭangkaina a nei lo va, sâwtna a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inṭhendarhna tichhuaktu chu vawi hnih khat zilh la, ngaihven zui duh suh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chutiang mi zawng rilru kawi chhe pu tawh an ni tih i hria a, an tisual a ni tih pawh an inhre reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Artema emaw Tukika emaw i hnêna ka rawn tirh veleh nang chuan Nikopoli khuaah mi rawn pan thuai ang che, chutah chuan thlasik chhûng zawng awm ka tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zena, dânhremi leh Apolova chuan, an zin kawnga eng mah an tlâkchham loh nân i theihtâwpin ṭanpui ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan mite chu thil ṭha tiin inhmang ṭhîn rawh se, inthlahdah mai mai lovin hetiang thil ṭûl mamawh lo awm ṭhîn hi an phuhrûk thei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hnêna awm zawng zawng hian chibai an bûk a che u. Rinnaa kan ṭhiante kha chibai ka bûk e. In zaa hnênah khawngaihna awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
